WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.690
Let’s open PRLX in the Terminal.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.210
You can switch the chart’s

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.770
time frame, zoom in,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.370
and open the token evidence

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:08.880
when you want a closer look.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.140
Now, over here

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.610
is the Planet Atlas.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.330
Browse the project worlds,

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.690
then choose a destination

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.880
from Atlas Station.

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.980
Come click around at parallaxlaunch.live.

